{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require Strengthened Mandatory Account Verification & Limit Message Functions",
        "additional_details": "Online bullying can seriously harm people's wellbeing. We are concerned that some people create multiple accounts to target victims repeatedly from new accounts, and to send harassing messages which the victim may struggle to block. We believe that people who report receiving abuse on platforms deserve proper consideration and meaningful reviews of decisions. I want the Government to require platforms to take effective action against repeat harassment. We think users should have greater control over who contacts them and that platforms must do more to verify and identify users who create multiple accounts for the purpose of harassing someone.",
        "background": "Require social media platforms to strengthen account verification and identification to prevent multiple accounts being created by the same person to be used for bullying and harassment & offer option to block all unsolicited messages from people they have not connected with already on the platform.",
